   {"who": "", "skiri": "a tsikstit ka rasta•pí•hat?", "english": "and are you all (family) doing well?"},
   {"who": "B", "skiri": "Ahu', tsikstit tahra•pi•hat.", "english": "Yes, we're fine."},
   {"who": "", "skiri": "Kirike rusutsíks•ari'?", "english": "What have you been doing?"},
   {"who": "A", "skiri": "Tikú•riusis•ari ratku•wá•waktit Pari' ...", "english": "I've been learning to speak Pawnee ..."},
   {"who": "", "skiri": "(Parí pakuru ... ratara•kuki.)", "english": "(the Pawnee language ... in our way.)"},
   {"who": "B", "skiri": "Ka ras•í•waktits? Rarit ka rás•paku, Pari'?", "english": "Is that true? Do you speak it well, Pawnee?"},
   {"who": "A", "skiri": "Rarít kakat•paku', ketsi ríku•riusis•ari.", "english": "I don't speak well, but I'm learning."},
